

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Amazing Animals | Kids Learning Hub</title>
<meta name="description" content="Explore amazing animals, play fun quizzes and discover the animal world!">
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
 background:#fffaf0;
 color:#35434a;
}
header{
 background:#77c9a5;
 padding:20px;
 text-align:center;
 color:#fff;
}
header h1{font-size:32px;margin:5px}
nav{
 background:#fff;
 padding:15px;
 text-align:center;
 position:sticky;
 top:0;
}
nav a{
 color:#277b61;
 text-decoration:none;
 margin:8px;
 font-weight:bold;
}
.hero{
 text-align:center;
 padding:45px 18px;
 background:#fff0c9;
}
.hero h2{font-size:32px;color:#397b61}
.hero p{font-size:18px}
section{
 padding:30px 18px;
 text-align:center;
}
.cards{
 display:grid;
 grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));
 gap:15px;
 max-width:850px;
 margin:auto;
}
.card{
 background:#fff;
 border-radius:18px;
 padding:20px 12px;
 box-shadow:0 3px 10px #00000010;
}
.animal{font-size:55px}
.card h3{color:#39866b}
button{
 background:#54ae86;
 color:white;
 border:0;
 padding:13px 20px;
 border-radius:12px;
 font-size:16px;
 cursor:pointer;
 margin:8px;
}
#answer{font-weight:bold;min-height:28px}
footer{
 background:#77c9a5;
 text-align:center;
 color:white;
 padding:25px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<h1>🐾 Amazing Animals 🐾</h1>
<p>Play • Learn • Colour • Discover</p>
</header>

<nav>
<a href="#animals">Animals</a>
<a href="#facts">Learn</a>
<a href="#quiz">Quiz</a>
<a href="#colour">Colouring</a>
</nav>

<div class="hero">
<h2>Welcome to Amazing Animals!</h2>
<p>Discover wonderful animals from all around the world.</p>
<p>Learn something new every day!</p>
<a href="#animals"><button>Explore Animals 🐘</button></a>
</div>

<section id="animals">
<h2>🌍 Meet Our Amazing Animals</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<div class="animal">🦁</div>
<h3>Lion</h3>
<p>The king of the jungle!</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="animal">🐘</div>
<h3>Elephant</h3>
<p>A giant with a long trunk.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="animal">🦒</div>
<h3>Giraffe</h3>
<p>The tallest land animal.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="animal">🐼</div>
<h3>Panda</h3>
<p>A bear that loves bamboo.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="animal">🐬</div>
<h3>Dolphin</h3>
<p>A clever ocean swimmer.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div class="animal">🐧</div>
<h3>Penguin</h3>
<p>A bird that loves swimming.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="facts" style="background:#e5f5ec">
<h2>📚 Animal Fun Facts</h2>
<div class="cards">
<div class="card">
<h3>Elephants</h3>
<p>Elephants use their trunks to smell, drink and pick things up.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Giraffes</h3>
<p>Giraffes have very long necks to help them reach tall trees.</p>
</div>
<div class="card">
<h3>Dolphins</h3>
<p>Dolphins use sounds to communicate with each other.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="quiz">
<h2>🧠 Animal Quiz Time!</h2>
<p>Which animal has a very long neck?</p>
<button onclick="check('Lion')">Lion</button>
<button onclick="check('Giraffe')">Giraffe</button>
<button onclick="check('Panda')">Panda</button>
<p id="answer" aria-live="polite"></p>
</section>

<section id="colour" style="background:#fff0c9">
<h2>🎨 Colouring Corner</h2>
<p>Get ready for fun animal colouring adventures!</p>
<p>Our printable animal colouring pages are coming soon.</p>
</section>

<footer>
<h2>🐾 Amazing Animals</h2>
<p>Making learning fun, one animal at a time!</p>
<p>© 2026 Amazing Animals</p>
</footer>

<script>
function check(answer){
 const result=document.getElementById("answer");
 if(answer==="Giraffe"){
  result.textContent="🌟 Fantastic! You got it right!";
 }else{
  result.textContent="😊 Good try! Have another go!";
 }
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
